# Build context for pacod-id.Dockerfile. BuildKit prefers this file over a .dockerignore in the
# context's root.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!deploy/docker/healthcheck.rs

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!packages/*/package.json
!fixtures/*/package.json
!packages/ui
!ui

# Never part of a build, wherever they are: outputs, dependencies, local files.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/build-container
**/.svelte-kit
ui/src/lib/paraglide
ui/project.inlang/*
!ui/project.inlang/settings.json
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.tgz
